Privacy Policy
Last Updated: May 24, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how LightBox handles your information when you use the App.

By using LightBox, you agree to this policy.

## 1. Information We Process

### 1.1 Images You Upload

When you use LightBox, you voluntarily upload images for AI-based enhancement. These images are transmitted to third-party AI service providers (such as Google Gemini) for processing.

We do not permanently store your images on our own servers.

### 1.2 Subscription Information

If you purchase a subscription or credits, Apple processes your payment. We may receive limited, non-sensitive transaction information (such as subscription status) via Apple’s system.

### 1.3 Usage and Technical Data

We may receive basic, anonymized technical data such as crash logs or performance metrics to improve app stability. This data does not directly identify you.

## 2. How We Use Information

We use the information solely to:

* Process and enhance images using AI services
* Provide subscription and credit functionality
* Maintain and improve app performance

## 3. Third-Party Services

LightBox uses third-party providers, including:

* Google Gemini (AI image processing)
* Apple (payments and subscriptions)

Your images are transmitted to these providers only for processing purposes. These providers may handle data according to their own privacy policies.

## 4. Data Storage

We do not maintain long-term storage of user-uploaded images on our servers.

Processed results may exist temporarily on your device within the App until you choose to delete them or uninstall the App.

## 5. Data Deletion and Requests

Since we do not store user images long-term on our servers, deletion requests primarily relate to data held within your device or processed by third-party providers.

If you have questions or concerns about your data, you may contact us at [info@mypicturesbox.com](mailto:info@mypicturesbox.com) and we will assist where reasonably possible.

## 6. Children’s Privacy

LightBox is not intended for users under 13 (or the minimum age required in your country). We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.

## 7. Security

We take reasonable measures to protect data during transmission, but no system is completely secure.

## 8. Changes

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Continued use of the App indicates acceptance of any changes.

## 9. Contact

If you have questions, contact: [info@mypicturesbox.com](mailto:info@mypicturesbox.com)
